╭─ Patch Generation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ To resolve the issue where QuerySet.in_bulk() fails for fields     │
│ that are part of a UniqueConstraint (even when unique=True is not  │
│ explicitly set), we need to change the condition that determines   │
│ whether a field is considered unique. The current logic checks for │
│ the unique attribute, which is not sufficient when the field is    │
│ part of a UniqueConstraint.                                        │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                             Reasoning                              │
│                                                                    │
│ The in_bulk() method is designed to work with fields that are      │
│ unique, but the current implementation relies on the unique        │
│ attribute of the field. However, when a field is part of a         │
│ UniqueConstraint, the unique attribute may not be set, but the     │
│ constraint still requires the field to be unique. Therefore, the   │
│ check for unique is insufficient and needs to be replaced with a   │
│ check for the presence of a UniqueConstraint in the model's        │
│ Meta.constraints.                                                  │
│                                                                    │
│ The correct approach is to iterate through the Meta.constraints    │
│ and check if the field is present in any of the UniqueConstraint   │
│ objects.                                                           │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                               Patch                                │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  [file]django/db/models/query.py[/file]                            │
│  <                                                                 │
│                                                                    │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
